'''Lizzy''' (Japanese: '''ユカリ''' ''Yukari'') is a [[character of the day]] who appeared in ''[[EP130|A Bout With Sprout]]''. She is a student at [[Earl Dervish|Earl]]'s [[Pokémon academy]].

Lizzy was first seen approaching [[Ash's Pikachu]], wanting to play with him, but this quickly erupted into an argument with [[Zackie]], who also wanted to play. In class, she sat next to Zackie and showed a keen interest in {{Ash}}'s stories about his [[Pokémon battle]]s. She was later seen with the other students at the [[Sprout Tower]] before they evacuated due to a sudden build-up of smoke.

